:: Bailey HQ Fence Climb
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 15>><<alertnessclamp>>
	<<passoutbaileyhq>>
<<else>>
	You grab hold of the chainlink fence 
	<<if $physiqueSuccess is 1>>
		<span class="green">and manage to climb up to the barbed wires.</span> 
		<<if $willpowerSuccess is 1>>
			You take a deep breath and proceed to pull yourself over the barbed wires, it scratches your entire body and tears your clothes, <span class="green">but you manage to grit your teeth and fight against the pain without making a sound.</span><<gggpain>><<gggstress>><<pain 50>><<stress 24>>
			<br><br>

			<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.genitals.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.under_lower.integrity -= 20>>
			<<set $worn.under_upper.integrity -= 20>>

			<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
				<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts]]>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Outskirts Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
				<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<generate5>><<generate6>><<person1>>
			<<else>>
				<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<person1>>
			<</if>>
			You take a deep breath and proceed to pull yourself over the barbed wires, it scratches your entire body and tears your clothes, <span class="red">but the pain is too much and you let out a painful exclaim before falling on the other side.</span> The guards are alerted, <span class="red">you can see guards closing in your location.</span><<gggpain>><<gggstress>><<pain 50>><<stress 24>><<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 10>><<alertnessclamp>>

			<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.genitals.integrity -= 50>>
			<<set $worn.under_lower.integrity -= 20>>
			<<set $worn.under_upper.integrity -= 20>>

			<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
				<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Outskirts Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
			<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<person1>>
		<<else>>
			<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<generate5>><<generate6>><<person1>>
		<</if>>
		<span class="red">but lose your grip and let out a painful exclaim</span> with the chainlink fence rattling as you fall onto your back. The guards are alerted, <span class="red">you can see them running after you.</span><<ggpain>><<ggstress>><<pain 12>><<stress 12>><<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 10>><<alertnessclamp>>
		<br><br>
		
		<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
			<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Outskirts Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Fence Wirecutter
<<effects>>

You take out your wirecutter and start snipping away at the fence. Not long after, you have a human sized hole in the fence for easy access. You reckon it'll be a day before they notice and another to fix it.
<br><br>

<<set $baileyHQ.fenceHole to 1>><<set $baileyHQ.fenceFix to 2>><<set $baileyHQ.nextDayAlertness += 25>>

<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Outskirts]]>><</link>>

:: Bailey HQ Fence Dig
<<effects>>

<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
	<<set _check to 100>>
<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
	<<set _check to 75>>
<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 5>>
	<<set _check to 50>>
<<else>>
	<<set _check to 25>>
<</if>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 15>><<alertnessclamp>>
	<<passoutbaileyhq>>
<<elseif random(1, 100) lte _check>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		You were digging with your shovel when you notice 
	<<else>>
		You were digging with your hands when you notice 
	<</if>>
	<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<person1>>
		<span class="red">four guards</span> 
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<person1>>
		<span class="red">three guards</span> 
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 5>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<person1>>
		<span class="red">two guards</span> 
	<<else>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		<span class="red">one guard</span> 
	<</if>>
	coming your way on their patrol. Your surroundings are barren, you'd have to run a distance and fast to make it to a hiding spot or try to bluff. 
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<span class="red">It's going to be difficult explaining why you have a shovel.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You're going to have to explain why your hands are so dirty.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Run to a hiding spot|Bailey HQ Fence Dig Run]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 500 1250>><<gtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 2000>>
		<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1500>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 750>>
	<</if>>
	<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $skulduggerydifficulty / 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Bluff|Bailey HQ Fence Dig Bluff]]>><</link>><<englishdifficulty 400 1200>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<<else>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		You use your shovel to quickly dig a hole under the fence. 
		<<set $baileyHQ.fenceTunnelProgress += 5>>
	<<else>>
		You use your hands to painfully dig a hole under the fence. 
		<<set $baileyHQ.fenceTunnelProgress += 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $baileyHQ.fenceTunnelProgress gte 15>>
		<span class="green">The hole is big enough to let you slip under the fence.</span>
		<<set $baileyHQ.fenceTunnel to 1>><<set $baileyHQ.fenceTunnelFix to 3>><<set $baileyHQ.nextDayAlertness += 10>>
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.fenceTunnelProgress gte 10>>
		<span class="teal">There's a little bit left.</span>
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.fenceTunnelProgress gte 5>>
		<span class="blue">A decent amount of progress has been done.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">There's still a lot of dirt to dig.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $baileyHQ.fenceTunnelProgress lt 15>>
		<<link [[Continue (0:10)|Bailey HQ Fence Dig]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
		<<link [[Back|Bailey HQ Outskirts]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Back|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Fence Dig Run
<<effects>>

You break into a sprint, straining yourself to run into the forest as fast as possible.
<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
	You're almost in viewing range before you dive into the foliage.
<<else>>
	You're almost in viewing range before you  
	<<if random(1,50) lte 50>>
		reach an empty vehicle, grabbing one of its edges to use your momentum to swing around the corner and use the car as cover.
	<<else>>
		reach a building, grabbing its edge to use your momentum to swing around the corner and use the building as cover.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

Your heart beats hard as you peek 
<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
	out of the foliage.
<<else>>
	around the corner.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $athleticsSuccess is 1>>
	You see the 
	<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
		guards 
	<<else>>
		guard 
	<</if>>
	walk past, <span class="green">none the wiser to your presense.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You don't see them. You look around confused before hands grab you from behind. "<span class="red">Gotcha</span>, you're not supposed to be here, and you're going to pay the price."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Fence Dig Bluff
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
		The guards 
	<<else>>
		The guard 
	<</if>>
	<<if Time.daystate isnot "night">>
		spot you and pause for a moment before striding towards you. 
	<<else>>
		spot you as their flashlights all center towards you. 
	<</if>>
	"Who the hell are you? What's the shovel for?" the <<person>> barks.
	<br><br>
	<<if $englishSuccess is 1>>
		<<if random(1, 100) gte 50>>
			<<set _type to 1>>
			You stare at them, never breaking eye contact as you emotionlessly say "A grave."
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			<<set _type to 2>>
			<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
				"A-a hole was found...! I was ordered to fill it back up...	" you say.
			<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
				"Open your fucking eyes, I'm filling up the hole, what else?" you say.
			<<else>>
				"Bailey's orders, an animal or something dug up a hole under the fence, I was filling it." you say.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<skulduggerycheck>>
		<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
			<<if _type is 1>>
				<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
					The guards pause
				<<else>>
					The guard pauses
				<</if>>
				, waiting for elaboration but you don't. They look at each other, confused, unnerved by the potential implications before the <<person>> mutters "S-sorry for bothering you <<psir>>, we'll get out of your way."
				<br><br>

				They walk past you, you stare. They speed up, you stare. They break into a run, and still you stare, until they are out of sight.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
					The guards pause
				<<else>>
					The guard pauses
				<</if>>
				, eyes going from you, to the shovel, to the hole before the <<person>> 
				<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 25>>
					grumbles "Fine, why the hell didn't they brief me? We're all on edge as it is." 
				<<elseif $baileyHQ.alertness gte 15>>
					sighs "Alright, we think someone's been sneaking around so let us know if you see anyone suspicious yeah?" 
				<<else>>
					clicks their tongue "Tsk, thought we'd get some action. Fine, go on." 
				<</if>>
				and walking away, not giving you another glance.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			The <<person>> takes out a walkie talkie and inquires through it, striding towards you while keeping eye contact. "HQ, I got someone out here with a shovel, did you send anyone? No?" their lips curling into a smile, "Roger that." as 
			<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
				the guards completely surround you. 
			<<else>>
				the guard grabs your arm, 
			<</if>>
			<span class="red">"You're not going anywhere sweetheart."</span>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		"I uh, I was... Uh, digging...?"" you stammer.
		<br><br>

		<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
			The guards chuckle 
		<<else>>
			The guard chuckles 
		<</if>>
		"Uhuh, yeah no, nobody's believing you. You're coming with me."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
		The guards 
	<<else>>
		The guard 
	<</if>>
	<<if Time.daystate isnot "night">>
		spot you and pause for a moment before striding towards you. 
	<<else>>
		spot you as their flashlights all center towards you. 
	<</if>>
	"Who the hell are you? Why are you here?" the <<person>> barks.
	<br><br>
	<<if $englishSuccess is 1>>
		<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
			<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
				"I-I was just looking around..." you say.
			<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
				"That's none of your business." you say.
			<<else>>
				"I was just looking around." you say.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
				"I-I'm just taking a break..." you say.
			<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
				"Mind your own business, can't I get some peace on breaks?" you say.
			<<else>>
				"I'm just taking a break, I like the quiet here." you say.
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<skulduggerycheck>>
		<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
			<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
				The guards pause
			<<else>>
				The guard pauses
			<</if>>
			, contemplating on your answer before saying 
			<<if $location is "Bailey HQ Outskirts">>
				"Then I'll have to ask you to leave, this is a restricted <<psir>>." as they give you a curt nod, leaving you alone to do their rounds.
			<<else>>
				"Must be new then, I'll let you off but buy me a drink eh?" as they give you a dismissive wave, leaving you alone to do their rounds.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			The <<person>> takes out a walkie talkie and inquires through it, striding towards you while keeping eye contact. "HQ, I got someone out here with a shovel, did you send anyone? No?" their lips curling into a smile, "Roger that." as 
			<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
				the guards completely surround you. 
			<<else>>
				the guard grabs your arm, 
			<</if>>
			<span class="red">"You're not going anywhere sweetheart."</span>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		"I uh, I'm just taking a break...?" you stammer.
		<br><br>

		<<if $enemyno gt 1>>
			The guards chuckle 
		<<else>>
			The guard chuckles 
		<</if>>
		"Sorry hun, I know every face here.", they stride towards you with a smile on their face "I usually get them to buy me a drink but I think you need a bigger punishment..."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

