:: Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Traverse Distract
<<effects>>

<<set $rng to random(1, 100)>>
You grab 
<<if $rng gte 67>>
	a brick, try to time it when both guards aren't looking and throw it against a car, causing a loud bang, which startling the guards.
<<elseif $rng gte 33>>
	an empty bottle, try to time it when both guards aren't looking and throw it against a barrel, causing a loud crash, startling the guards.
<<else>>
	a rock, try to time it when both guards aren't looking and throw it against a container, causing a loud bang, startling the guards.
<</if>>
<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if $rng gte 67>>
		"What was that?"
		<br>
		"Did some blighter just throw a brick at Bailey's car!?"
		<br>
		"We're fucked."
		<br><br>

		A smirk creeps onto your face as you <span class="green">slip past them unnoticed</span>.
	<<elseif $rng gte 33>>
		"The fuck? Was that glass?"
		<br>
		"Is some idiot drinking on the job?"
		<br>
		"Bailey's gonna be mad... Let's check it out."
		<br><br>

		You <span class="green">slip past them unnoticed</span>.
	<<else>>
		"Was that one of the containers?"
		<br>
		"I think someone's breaking in, let's go."
		<br>
		"Fine, there's goes our bloody break."
		<br><br>

		You <span class="green">slip past them unnoticed</span>.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next (0:05)|Bailey HQ Inner]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"Oi! You think we're blind!? Get over here!" the <<person>> exclaims.
	<br>
	You didn't time it right.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Inner Outskirts Traverse Distract Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

