		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<person1>>
	<<else>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
	<</if>>
	"<span class="red">Well well well, what do we have here?</span>" 
	<br><br>

	You startle to a stop before looking down to see a <<person>> looking straight at you.
	<br><br>

	"Oh don't mind 
	<<if $baileyHQ.alertness gte 5>>
		us.
	<<else>>
		me.
	<</if>>
	Keep going, whichever you choose, we'll be there." the <<person>> says smirking.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Face them on the rooftop|Bailey HQ Rooftop Ladder Caught]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Face them on the ground|Bailey HQ Inner Ladder Caught]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	Nobody has noticed you yet. 
	<<if $baileyHQ.ladderProgress gte 3>>
		You're almost at the top.
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.ladderProgress gte 2>>
		You're halfway up the ladder.
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.ladderProgress gte 1>>
		You're about a quarter up.
	<<else>>
		You're at the bottom.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $baileyHQ.ladderProgress is 0>>
		<<link [[Get off the ladder (0:01)|Bailey HQ Inner]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $baileyHQ.ladderProgress is 4>>
		<<link [[Get onto the rooftop (0:01)|Bailey HQ Rooftop]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $baileyHQ.ladderProgress lt 4>>
		<<link [[Go up the ladder (0:01)|Bailey HQ Ladder Traverse]]>><<set $baileyHQ.ladderProgress += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $baileyHQ.ladderProgress gt 0>>
		<<link [[Go down the ladder (0:01)|Bailey HQ Ladder Traverse]]>><<set $baileyHQ.ladderProgress -= 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Access Door
<<effects>>

You throw all caution into the wind and simply stroll through the access door and as soon as you get through it, an alarm blares. <span class="red">They know you're here.</span>
<br><br>

